;- API design only — no callable functions are implemented in this module yet.
  Proposed functions:
      network.connect(host, port)
      network.listen(host, port)
      network.accept(server)
      network.send(handle, text)
      network.receive(handle, size)
      network.close(handle)
      network.lastError()

  The socket handle type, TLS, DNS, blocking mode, timeout behavior, and platform support
  need explicit contracts before these operations can be safely enabled. -;
